      {
        "id": 3551011545,
        "node_id": "PR_kwDOM9d8tc7TqCLZ",
        "number": 20,
        "state": "closed",
        "title": "feat: replace kasada with vercel botid",
        "body": "## Summary\n- Removes all Kasada bot detection infrastructure (client SDK, server handler, proxy route)\n- Integrates [Vercel BotID](https://vercel.com/docs/botid) as replacement\n- Adds `checkBotId()` server-side verification in the `generateQuery` server action\n- Existing rate limiting middleware preserved as-is\n\n## Changes\n- **`app/layout.tsx`**: Replaced `KasadaClient` with `BotIdClient` (protects `POST /`)\n- **`next.config.js`**: Wrapped with `withBotId()` for proxy rewrites\n- **`middleware.ts`**: Removed Kasada handler, kept rate limiting\n- **`app/actions.ts`**: Added `checkBotId()` gate in `generateQuery`\n- **Deleted**: `utils/kasada/*`, `app/(kasada)/*` (Kasada client, server, proxy route)\n\n## Post-merge\n- Remove `KASADA_TOKEN` env var from project settings\n- Enable BotID Deep Analysis in the Vercel dashboard Firewall tab if desired",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/vercel-labs/natural-language-postgres/pull/20",
        "created_at": "2026-04-19T01:06:45Z",
