      {
        "id": 3472441842,
        "node_id": "PR_kwDOM9d8tc7O-UHy",
        "number": 19,
        "state": "closed",
        "title": "chore: upgrade AI SDK dependencies and refactor to new API",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nUpgrades AI SDK and related dependencies to the latest versions, refactoring the codebase to align with the new API while converting schema fields from optional to nullable.\n\n## Changes\n\n**Dependencies (`package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`)**\n\n- Upgrade ai-sdk and ai packages to latest versions\n- Reduce lock file size by removing unnecessary transitive dependencies\n\n**Types (`lib/types.ts`)**\n\n- Refactor schema fields from optional to nullable\n- Update type definitions to match new AI SDK API\n\n**Actions (`app/actions.ts`)**\n\n- Update implementation to use new AI SDK API\n- Adjust OpenAI model specification for new SDK version\n\n---\n\n[Chat](https://openharness.dev/sessions/XQ6A-bZ4Uql26afGR9P7Q/chats/5c728e30-0cba-454f-bdf3-dd4d63aee2be) - Built with guidance from [Nico Albanese](https://github.com/nicoalbanese)",
